en uns umgehend bei Ihnen zurück.</p>\n            \n            <form id=\"somerville-quick-inquiry\" class=\"space-y-4\" onsubmit=\"event.preventDefault(); submitInquiryForm(this);\">\n              <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4\">\n                <div>\n                  <label class=\"block text-xs font-semibold text-[#FFFCF5]/80 uppercase tracking-wider mb-1.5\">Ihr Name *</label>\n                  <input type=\"text\" name=\"name\" required placeholder=\"Vor- und Nachname\" class=\"w-full px-4 py-3 rounded-xl bg-white/5 border border-white/15 text-white placeholder-white/40 text-sm focus:outline-none focus:border-[#E31936] transition-colors\">\n                </div>\n                <div>\n                  <label class=\"block text-xs font-semibold text-[#FFFCF5]/80 uppercase tracking-wider mb-1.5\">Telefon / Mobil *</label>\n                  <input type=\"tel\" name=\"phone\" required placeholder=\"z. B. 0172 1234567\" class=\"w-full px-4 py-3 rounded-xl bg-white/5 border border-white/15 text-white placeholder-white/40 text-sm focus:outline-none focus:border-[#E31936] transition-colors\">\n                </div>\n              </div>\n\n              <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4\">\n                <div>\n                  <label class=\"block text-xs font-semibold text-[#FFFCF5]/80 uppercase tracking-wider mb-1.5\">E-Mail-Adresse *</label>\n                  <input type=\"email\" name=\"email\" required placeholder=\"ihre-adresse@beispiel.de\" class=\"w-full px-4 py-3 rounded-xl bg-white/5 border border-white/15 text-white placeholder-white/40 text-sm focus:outline-none focus:border-[#E31936] transition-colors\">\n                </div>\n                <div>\n                  <label class=\"block text-xs font-semibold text-[#FFFCF5]/80 uppercase tracking-wider mb-1.5\">Gewerk / Vorhaben</label>\n                  <select name=\"gewerk\" class=\"w-full px-4 py-3 rounded-xl bg-[#2C2B28] border border-white/15 text-white text-sm focus:outline-none focus:border-[#E31936] transition-colors\">\n                    <option value=\"Zimmerei & Dachstuhl\">Zimmerei & Dachstuhl</option>\n                    <option value=\"Treppen- & Möbelbau\">Treppen- & Möbelbau</option>\n                    <option value=\"Sägewerk & Lohnschnitt\">Sägewerk & Lohnschnitt</option>\n                    <option value=\"Maurer- & Massivbauarbeiten\">Maurer- & Massivbauarbeiten</option>\n                    <option value=\"Pellets & Brennstoffe\">Pellets & Holzbriketts</option>\n                    <option value=\"Allgemeine Anfrage\">Sonstiges / Vor-Ort-Termin</option>\n                  </select>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n\n              <div>\n                <label class=\"block text-xs font-semibold text-[#FFFCF5]/80 uppercase tracking-wider mb-1.5\">Kurze Beschreibung Ihres Vorhabens</label>\n                <textarea name=\"message\" rows=\"3\" placeholder=\"Maße, Standort, Zeitrahmen oder sonstige Details...\" class=\"w-full px-4 py-3 rounded-xl bg-white/5 border border-white/15 text-white placeholder-white/40 text-sm focus:outline-none focus:border-[#E31936] transition-colors\"></textarea>\n              </div>\n\n              <div class=\"flex items-start gap-2.5 pt-1\">\n                <input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"dsgvo-consent\" required class=\"mt-1 rounded bg-white/10 border-white/20 text-[#E31936] focus:ring-[#E31936]\">\n                <label for=\"dsgvo-consent\" class=\"text-xs text-[#A39E93] leading-snug\">\n                  Ich willige ein, dass meine Angaben zur Kontaktaufnahme und Zuordnung meiner Anfrage verarbeitet werden. Details in der <a href=\"/datenschutz/\" class=\"underline text-white hover:text-[#E31936]\">Datenschutzerklärung</a>.\n                </label>\n              </div>\n\n              <div id=\"inquiry-form-status\" class=\"hidden text-xs py-3 px-4 rounded-xl\"></div>\n\n              <button type=\"submit\" class=\"w-full btn-pill-light justify-center text-sm py-3.5 bg-[#E31936] hover:bg-[#c9142e] text-white border-none shadow-lg\">\n                <span>Unverbindliche Anfrage absenden</span>\n                <svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-white\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n                  <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" d=\"M14 5l7 7m0 0l-7 7m7-7H3\"/>\n                </svg>\n              </button>\n            </form>\n          </div>\n\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Offizieller Fördermittelhinweis (SAB & EU / EFRE) -->\n      <div class=\"my-12 p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-[24px] bg-white text-[#1A1918] shadow-2xl border border-white/20\">\n        <div class=\"flex flex-col lg:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-8\">\n          <!-- Offizielles Signet: EU & Freistaat Sachsen -->\n          <div class=\"w-full lg:w-5/12 flex-shrink-0 flex items-center justify-center lg:justify-start\">\n            <img \n              src=\"https://bau-mueller.eu/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/EFRE-ESF_LO_Kombination_EU-Logo_SachsenSignet-klassisch_HF_RGB_300dpi.jpg\" \n              alt=\"Kofinanziert von der Europäischen Union und dem Freistaat Sachsen – Sächsische Aufbaubank (SAB)\" \n              class=\"max-w-full h-auto max-h-[85px] object-contain\"\n              loading=\"lazy\"\n            >\n          </div>\n          \n          <!-- Fördertext & Button -->\n          <div class=\"w-full lg:w-7/12 flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-6\">\n            <p class=\"text-sm sm:text-[15px] italic text-[#3A3632] leading-relaxed\">\n              „Unser Projekt <strong>„Werkstatt der Zukunft – Präzision trifft Tradition“</strong> wird durch die Europäische Union und den Freistaat Sachsen unterstützt. Die Maßnahme wird über die Sächsische Aufbaubank (SAB) gefördert.“\n            </p>\n            <a \n              href=\"/werkstatt-der-zukunft-praezision-trifft-tradition/\" \n              class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 px-6 py-3.5 rounded-full bg-[#2563EB] hover:bg-[#1D4ED8] text-white font-medium text-sm transition-all duration-200 shrink-0 shadow-md hover:shadow-lg\"\n            >\n              <span>Hier geht es zum Artikel</span>\n              <svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-white\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n                <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M14 5l7 7m0 0l-7 7m7-7H3\"/>\n              </svg>\n            </a>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Navigation & Info Columns -->\n      <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-4 gap-10 py-16 text-sm\">\n        <div>\n          <h4 class=\"font-heading font-bold text-white text-base mb-4 uppercase tracking-wider text-xs\">Standort</h4>\n          <p class=\"text-muted-dark leading-relaxed\">\n            Zimmerei & Baugeschäft Arthur Müller e.K.<br>\n            Geithainer Str. 32<br>\n            04680 Colditz<br>\n            Inhaber: Dipl.-Ing. Tobias Müller\n          </p>\n        </div>\n        <div>\n          <h4 class=\"font-heading font-bold text-white text-base mb-4 uppercase tracking-wider text-xs\">Gewerke</h4>\n          <ul class=\"space-y-2.5 text-muted-dark\">\n            <li><a href=\"/leistungen/\" class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors\">Zimmerei & Holzbau</a></li>\n            <li><a href=\"/leistungen/\" class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors\">Treppen- & Möbelbau</a></li>\n            <li><a href=\"/leistungen/\" class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors\">Maurer- & Betonarbeiten</a></li>\n            <li><a href=\"/leistungen/\" class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors\">Altbausanierung & Denkmal</a></li>\n            <li><a href=\"/leistungen/\" class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors\">Pellets & Holzbriketts</a></li>\n          </ul>\n        </div>\n        <div>\n          <h4 class=\"font-heading font-bold text-